    "checklist": {
      "reviewed": 4,
      "passRate": 50,
      "items": {
        "A print stylesheet (`@media print`) hides the app navigation, buttons and toasts, and sets an A4 page size and margins with `@page`": 100,
        "The document shows seller and buyer blocks (name, address, tax code), the invoice number, the issue date and the due date": 0,
        "Line items show description, quantity, unit price, tax rate and line amount, with numbers right-aligned in tabular figures and the currency stated": 100,
        "A totals block shows the subtotal, tax per rate, the total and the amount paid or due, and the totals equal the sum of the lines": 100,
        "A long item table breaks across pages without splitting rows, and its header row repeats on each printed page": 100,
        "The printed page stays readable in black and white: no meaning carried by colour alone and no light grey text below 4.5:1": 100,
        "On screen, the status is a badge with text (Draft, Issued, Paid, Overdue) and the actions (Print, Download PDF, Send) have one primary action": 100,
        "Dates and amounts follow one locale throughout, and payment details (bank account, payment reference) are shown": 100,
        "The document has a heading structure, and the items table has column headers marked up as header cells": 100,
        "Month and week views, a Today button and previous/next navigation, with the visible range written as text (such as \"November 2026\")": 100,
        "Today is marked, and weekends and public holidays are distinguishable by text or a legend, not by colour alone": 0,
        "Each leave shows the person and leave type in text, and pending requests differ from approved ones by text or a pattern, not by colour alone": 0,
        "A leave of several days spans its days continuously, and a crowded day shows \"+N more\" that opens the full list instead of hiding entries": 0,
        "Days where many people are off are flagged with a count (such as \"3 of 8 off\")": 0,
        "Opening a leave shows its absolute dates, its length in working days and its status, with approve and reject actions for pending requests": 0,
        "The calendar is keyboard operable (arrow keys in the grid, or every entry reachable in tab order), and entries have accessible names that include the date": 0,
        "Filters by team, person or leave type, and a list view as an alternative to the grid": 0,
        "Weeks start on the locale's first day, dates follow the locale, and empty, loading and error states are present": 0,
        "Columns by status show a count in their header (such as \"In progress 5\"), and a work-in-progress limit is shown where one applies": 0,
        "Cards show the ticket code, a title (truncated with the full text available), the priority as a text label, the assignee's name and the due date or age": 100,
        "A card can be moved without dragging (a \"Move to\" menu or the keyboard), and a drag-and-drop move is announced to assistive technology": 100,
        "Moving to a status that needs input (such as Resolved needing a resolution note) asks for it, and a move can be undone (a toast with Undo)": 0,
        "Filters for assignee and priority, a search, and a switch to a list or table view": 0,
        "Overdue or ageing tickets are marked with a text label, not by colour alone": 100,
        "Columns scroll on their own with sticky headers, and a wide board scrolls sideways without the page header scrolling away": 0,
        "An empty column shows a short empty state, and loading and an error with retry are present": 100,
        "Opening a card shows its details in a side panel without losing the board's position or filters": 0,
        "The hierarchy expands and collapses with indentation, and uses tree semantics (`role=\"tree\"`/`treeitem` with `aria-expanded` and `aria-level`, or a `treegrid`)": 100,
        "Keyboard: arrow keys move, expand and collapse, Home and End jump, and a search reveals matching accounts together with their parents": 0,
        "Each row shows the account code and name, balances are right-aligned in tabular figures, and a parent's balance equals the sum of its children": 100,
        "Selecting an account shows its details on the right without losing the tree's scroll position or expanded state, and the selection is kept in the URL": 0,
        "Expand all and collapse all are available, and the expanded state survives a reload": 0,
        "Deactivating or deleting an account that has a balance or child accounts is blocked or explained, not silently allowed": 100,
        "The detail panel shows the selected account's path (such as \"Assets / Current assets / Cash\")": 100,
        "A search with no match shows a no-results state, and loading and an error with retry are present": 100,
        "Rows are single-line, and long account names truncate with the full name available": 0
      }
    }
